# Build inputs and outputs (re-downloadable / regenerable).
# The published repository - the .xbps files, their .sig2 signatures and the
# <arch>-repodata index the installer consumes - lives at the repository root
# and IS tracked (GitHub Pages serves it). Only the scratch below is ignored.
/distfiles/
/hostdir/
/build/
*.tar.gz

# Signing keys (never commit)
*.pem

# external, never committed (see tools/check-maintainer.sh)
.maintainer-denylist

# Editor / OS noise
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
